","id":347037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NzAzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/347037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeSchulze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T19:21:12Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T19:25:50Z","body":"> Can confirm it is a gdUnit4 issue.\n\n@raulsntos  Sorry no, it worked without issues on Godot v4.4.1.stable.mono.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n<img width=\"1014\" height=\"189\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26a1ee52-3e0b-42d9-a01e-13aaf657ac29\" />\n\n<img width=\"1733\" height=\"337\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c3559f0-0ec4-490a-8a7f-592cbb15f9f9\" />\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3603617414/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3605181988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111881#issuecomment-3605181988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111881","id":3605181988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7W4rYk","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T05:42:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T05:42:05Z","body":"@MikeSchulze \n\nYou may see https://github.com/MikeSchulze/gdUnit4/issues/1010#issuecomment-3605177649 for a more detailed reply on why shipping external types to the `mono` module may cause problems.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3605181988/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619422436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111881#issuecomment-3619422436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111881","id":3619422436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XvADk","user":{"login":"Grutusk","id":98178192,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdoUkA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98178192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk","html_url":"https://github.com/Grutusk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T03:48:29Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T03:53:23Z","body":"I have no idea if it is Your case, but I started to get the issue after i created abstract class that inherits from RefCounted.\n\n`public abstract partial class CustomCalculation : RefCounted, ICustomCalculation` the abstract class isnt [GlobalClass] but it inherits from RefCounted so its apparently also registered.\n\nAnd have 2 inheritors\n\n`\n[GlobalClass]\npublic partial class MaxManaCalculation : CustomCalculation\n{\n`\n\n`\n[GlobalClass]\npublic partial class MaxHealthCalculation : CustomCalculation\n{\n`\n\nAs soon as i added this constelation to code, i started to get the duplicate key exception on CustomCalculation \n\n`\n  ERROR: /root/godot/modules/mono/glue/GodotSharp/GodotSharp/Core/NativeInterop/ExceptionUtils.cs:113 - System.ArgumentException: An item with the same key has already been added. Key: SmallAbilitySystem.Runtime.CustomCalculation\n  ERROR:    at System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary`2.Add(TKey key, TValue value)\n  ERROR:    at Godot.Bridge.ScriptManagerBridge.ScriptTypeBiMap.Add(IntPtr scriptPtr, Type scriptType) in /root/godot/modules/mono/glue/GodotSharp/GodotSharp/Core/Bridge/ScriptManagerBridge.types.cs:line 30\n  ERROR:    at Godot.Bridge.ScriptManagerBridge.TryReloadRegisteredScriptWithClass(IntPtr scriptPtr) in /root/godot/modules/mono/glue/GodotSharp/GodotSharp/Core/Bridge/ScriptManagerBridge.cs:line 681\n`\nRight now my workaround is to not inherit from RefCounted and use delegators, but i really don't like this problem.\n\nBtw wouldnt it make more sense to do _dictionary[key] = value instead of _dictinoary.Add() here when assembly reloads?\n\nAlso experience this issue -> https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/78513\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619422436/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619609352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111881#issuecomment-3619609352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111881","id":3619609352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XvtsI","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T06:00:11Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T06:00:11Z","body":"@Grutusk \n\n> Also experience this issue -> https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/78513\n\nAh, yes, this script-managed bridge-related issue always leads to 78513.\n\n> Btw wouldnt it make more sense to do _dictionary[key] = value instead of _dictinoary.Add() here when assembly reloads?\n\nYes and No: by design, a Type should NEVER be registered twice; if that happens, it always indicates one or more serious issues within the binding system (which means it SHOULD error out instead of silently replacing the value, as something might depend on it).\n\nIt would be best if you could create an MRP (minimal reproducible project) and attach it to a new issue, and we can continue the discussion there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619609352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619628038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111881#issuecomment-3619628038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111881","id":3619628038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XvyQG","user":{"login":"Grutusk","id":98178192,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdoUkA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98178192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk","html_url":"https://github.com/Grutusk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grutusk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T06:23:29Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T06:24:23Z","body":"Well i decided to dig deeper xD. Apparently when i moved the abstract class to its own file the problem was resolved (the abstract class was defined in same file as other class and it gave issues). I came to that conclusion when i tried to do MRP :). ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619628038/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619650264","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111881#issuecomment-3619650264","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111881","id":3619650264,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Xv3rY","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T06:37:47Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T06:37:47Z","body":"@Grutusk \n\n> I came to that conclusion when i tried to do MRP :).\n\nThat's good to hear. I agree that GodotSharp should include a more explicit warning about this; apparently, having multiple types in the same file is not supported.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619650264/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]